      "text": [
        " سُئِلَ أَبُو جَعْفَرٍ ( عليه السلام ) عَنِ الْقَلْسِ يُفَطِّرُ الصَّائِمَ قَالَ لَا ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Muhammad Bin Yahya, from Muhammad Bin Al Husayn, from Ali Bin Al Hakam, from Al A’ala Bin Razeyn, from Muhammad Bin Muslim who said, ",
          "‘Abu Ja’far<sup>asws</sup> was asked about the regurgitation, would the Fasting one break his Fast?’ He<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘No’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "5. Muhammad ibn Yahya has narrated from Muhammad ibn al-Husayn, from Ali ibn al-Hakam from al-‘Ala’ ibn Razin from Muhammad ibn Muslim who has said the following: “Abu Ja’far, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, was asked about burping if it invalidates the fast. He (the Imam) said, ‘No, it does not invalidate one’s fast.’” "
        ]
      }
    },
